# Why the Moon never lands
subtitle: "Newton's cannon and a falling apple show that the Moon falls toward Earth all the time and only its sideways speed makes it keep missing."
thumb: "band \"It's falling right now\" eyes card navy"
voices: {"a":"gemini:Iapetus | a clear, calm physics teacher with quiet wonder; natural pace","take":"lines"}

## Why the Moon never lands
    shape earth shape circle x 300 y 380 radius 144.5 style.fill #cfe3ee hidden true
